    4 │ 	Red,
  
  i Functions passed to makeSynchronous() run apart from the code around them.
  
  i Variables declared outside of the function don't exist where it runs, so using one throws an error.
  
  i Declare the variable inside the function, or pass its value to the function as an argument.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  

